            "text": "{\"proof\":\"by\\n  have hn : ∀ L : ℝ, ¬ Filter.Tendsto (fun n : ℕ => (n : ℝ)) Filter.atTop (𝓝 L) := by\\n    intro L h\\n    have hlt : ∀ᶠ n : ℕ in Filter.atTop, (n : ℝ) < L + 1 :=\\n      h.eventually (Set.isOpen_Iio.mem_nhds (lt_add_one L))\\n    have hge : ∀ᶠ n : ℕ in Filter.atTop, L + 1 ≤ (n : ℝ) :=\\n      tendsto_natCast_atTop_atTop.eventually\\n        (Filter.eventually_atTop.2 ⟨L + 1, fun _ hy => hy⟩)\\n    rcases (hlt.and hge).exists with ⟨n, hlt, hge⟩\\n    exact (not_le_of_gt hlt) hge\\n  refine ⟨{0}, (fun _ n => (n : ℝ)), (fun _ => 0), ?_, ?_⟩\\n  · intro x hx h\\n    rcases h.1 with ⟨L, hL⟩\\n    exact (hn L hL).elim\\n  · intro h\\n    rcases h.1 0 (by simp) with ⟨L, hL⟩\\n    exact hn L hL\",\"abstain_reason\":null}"
